<main class="support-page">
  <section class="support-shell">
    <a class="back-link" href="/">Back to Kenzap Factory</a>
    <div class="eyebrow">Support</div>
    <h1>Support and FAQ for Kenzap Factory</h1>
    <p class="intro">
      Use this page for Kenzap Factory questions, implementation planning, production workflow
      support, integration requests, or bug reports.
    </p>

    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-card">
        <div class="card-label">Best for direct help</div>
        <div class="card-title">Email support</div>
        <p>
          Use the form below or email <a href="mailto:support@kenzap.com">support@kenzap.com</a>.
          For Factory questions, include the module or workflow you’re working with and what outcome
          you’re trying to achieve.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-card accent">
        <div class="card-label">Operational context</div>
        <div class="card-title">Factory support notes</div>
        <p>
          The most useful support requests include whether you are asking about quoting, inventory,
          nesting integration, workshop execution, invoicing, or deployment. Clear context usually
          shortens the time to a useful reply.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="faq-section">
      <div class="section-label">Frequently asked questions</div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details open>
          <summary>What is the fastest way to get Factory support?</summary>
          <p>
            Send a short description of the problem, your workflow goal, and any screenshots or sample
            outputs that explain the issue. Email is the best path for implementation and support
            questions.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Can I ask about deployment or self-hosting here?</summary>
          <p>
            Yes. You can use this page for questions about managed deployment, customer-managed cloud,
            or self-hosted setups.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Can I ask about integrations?</summary>
          <p>
            Yes. Include the system you want to connect, what data should move between systems, and
            whether you need a one-way sync, two-way sync, or import/export workflow.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Do you publish user questions?</summary>
          <p>
            Only if you explicitly give permission. The support form includes an optional checkbox
            that allows publication of your question in edited FAQ form without personal details.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>What should I include in a bug report?</summary>
          <p>
            Include the page or module involved, the expected result, what happened instead, and the
            steps needed to reproduce the issue. Screenshots are often helpful.
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="form-section">
      <div class="section-label">Ask a question</div>
      <form
        name="factory-support"
        method="POST"
        data-netlify="true"
        data-netlify-recaptcha="true"
        netlify-honeypot="bot-field"
        action="/thank-you"
        class="support-form"
      >
        <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="factory-support" />
        <input type="hidden" name="product" value="Kenzap Factory" />
        <p class="honeypot">
          <label>
            Do not fill this out:
            <input name="bot-field" />
          </label>
        </p>

        <div class="field-grid">
          <label>
            <span>Name</span>
            <input type="text" name="name" autocomplete="name" required />
          </label>
          <label>
            <span>Email</span>
            <input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required />
          </label>
        </div>

        <label>
          <span>Company or environment</span>
          <input
            type="text"
            name="environment"
            placeholder="Example: sheet metal shop, self-hosted setup, managed cloud deployment..."
          />
        </label>

        <label>
          <span>Your question</span>
          <textarea
            name="message"
            rows="8"
            placeholder="Describe the issue, workflow, or request. Include enough context for us to understand what you are trying to achieve."
            required
          ></textarea>
        </label>

        <label class="checkbox-row">
          <input type="checkbox" name="publishConsent" value="yes" />
          <span>I give permission for Kenzap to publish this question in edited FAQ form without personal details.</span>
        </label>

        <div class="captcha-wrap" data-netlify-recaptcha="true"></div>

        <div class="form-actions">
          <button type="submit" class="submit-btn">Send request →</button>
          <div class="form-note">
            Your message is submitted through Netlify Forms. If the form is unavailable, email
            <a href="mailto:support@kenzap.com">support@kenzap.com</a> directly.
          </div>
        </div>
      </form>
    </section>
  </section>
</main>

